                <pb facs="0318" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg220"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-25"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25,
                        1900</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received via Taku, 26.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger states that the reported intention to remove Yangtze viceroys is said
                    by Li to be untrue.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
